The Horizon Gate Hotel is a hotel on the [[Geography/Black and White/Plaza|plaza]] in the [[Geography/Black and White/index|Black and White]], boarded up with a speaker on a pole outside. A caught sound poured into the speaker turns the boards to air and opens the entrance.

Inside are a lobby with a reception desk and a hallway of rooms, among them 101, 102 and 103, and speakers set in the walls, each playing a piece of music. Powering a speaker opens one passage through the building and seals another, and the entryway closes behind whoever comes in. Moving the sounds in a [[Phenomena/Voice Box|voice box]] between the speakers is how the front door is opened again.
